Text-free wide background texture for an open-source developer tool's social card. Solid matte deep slate ink background exactly #0F172A. Very sparse, low-contrast fragments of a clean dependency graph — a few small rounded-rectangle nodes and thin straight connector lines, placed toward the edges and corners, leaving broad calm empty negative space across the center for overlaid text. Almost everything in slate gray #334155 and #94A3B8; exactly one small connector segment or node in a single muted teal #2DD4BF accent. Flat 2D vector, matte, no gradients, no shadows, no 3D, no gloss, no glow, no neon, no texture fill, no text, no icons, no clutter. Understated, quiet, restrained — atmosphere meant to be dimmed behind bold white text. Technical OSS documentation aesthetic.
